# =============================================================================
# EDAC Utils Configuration Template
# =============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   This file configures the EDAC (Error Detection And Correction) utilities.
#   EDAC provides userspace tools to detect and report hardware memory errors
#   detected by the ECC memory controller drivers in the Linux kernel.
#
# Fields:
#   EDAC_DRIVER (string):
#     Specifies the desired EDAC driver to be manually loaded by the
#     init.d script when auto-loading fails. If left empty, no manual
#     loading attempt is made.
#
# =============================================================================

# If automated loading of driver for EDAC fails for you, specify
# desired driver to be handled by init.d script
#
# EDAC_DRIVER={{ EDAC_DRIVER | default('') }}